<title>FRANCE: RUGBY UNION-ITALY BEAT FRANCE 40-32.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ITALY BEAT FRANCE 40-32.</headline>
<dateline>GRENOBLE, France 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy beat France 40-32 (halftime 20-13) in a rugby union international on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>France - Tries: Penalty try, Pierre Bondouy 2, Jean-Luc Sadourny. Conversions: David Aucagne 3. Penalties: Aucagne 2</p>
<p>Italy - Tries: Ivan Francescato, Julian Gardner, Giambattista Croci, Paolo Vaccari. Conversions: Diego Dominguez 4. Penalties: Dominguez 4.</p>
